# This repository is LF-only in the working tree, not just in the index.
#
# Windows checkouts commonly set core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites text files to
# CRLF on checkout. scripts/generate-seed.mjs always writes LF, and
# lib/ai/prompts/defaults.test.ts compares the regenerated 002_seed_prompts.sql
# byte-for-byte -- so a CRLF checkout fails that test with an empty `git diff`,
# which is a genuinely confusing way to lose an afternoon.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
